{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17902","headline":"中书即事 · 裴度","name":"中书即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有意效承平，无功荅圣明。\n灰心缘忍事，霜鬓爲论兵。\n道直身还在，恩深命转轻。\n盐梅非拟议，葵藿是平生。\n白日长悬照，苍蝇谩发声。\n高阳旧田里，终使谢归耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}